@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title UC06 — Execute a reviewed migration: conversation
top to bottom direction
state "1. Execute reviewed digest\nAdministrator" as S1
state "2. Queue actor-bound run\nmigration_executor" as S2
state "3. Load bounded pending work\nexecute_migration / migration_executor" as S3
state "4. Revalidate and copy / skip\nmigration_executor / folder_destination" as S4
state "5. Report outcomes\nmigration_executor" as S5
state "Refused / blocked outcome" as Refused
